,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">亏千亿也要敲钟：Anthropic 创纪录 IPO 背后的算力账单</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI向ChatGPT Plus及Business用户开放dots智能助理测试</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌正式向开发者开放世界模型 Genie 4 API，每分钟调用成本约 6 美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3715b1972802d48a6b558e7509cbb221.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月19日，谷歌正式向开发者开放世界模型Genie 4，支持通过Gemini API及AI Studio调用。该模型可根据文本、图像或图文组合，实时生成720p、24fps的连续可交互世界，并同步生成环境音与对白，画面响应延迟在0.2至0.5秒之间。Genie 4主要定位交互原型设计、空间可视化及机器人与智能体训练，世界状态由Gemini模型维持连贯性。计费方面，该服务不设免费层，按Token计费，折算后视频输出成本约为6.05美元/分钟。官方提示，单次会话上限为120秒，最佳连贯性区间为45至90秒，且需显式调用complete()或cancel()以停止计费。目前该服务仅由美国数据中心提供，暂不支持持久化3D资产，且对网络延迟要求较高。同期，谷歌还发布了推理模型Gemini 4 Neon及Robotics</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元Hy4大模型正式全量开源，支持百万Token上下文与MoE架构</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/251646a3fd79fbdf3d24a2b3fcafa612.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月20日，腾讯混元团队正式开源Hy4大模型及Hy4flash版本，标志着混元LLM系列实现全量开放。开发者现可通过GitHub、Hugging Face、ModelScope及GitCode获取模型权重。旗舰版Hy4采用MoE混合专家架构，总参数量770B，激活参数49B，支持100万Token上下文窗口。高性价比版Hy4flash总参数量224B，激活参数12B，同样支持多模态输入与百万级上下文。两款模型均采用Apache 2.0协议，允许商业使用与修改。腾讯同步发布了Hy4安全评估卡片，明确训练数据剔除了漏洞利用等攻击性内容，并经腾讯玄武与科恩实验室审计，确保无明显进攻性能力风险。此次开源为企业级二次开发提供了宽松的授权基础，进一步丰富了国产开源大模型生态。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亏千亿也要敲钟：Anthropic 创纪录 IPO 背后的算力账单</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亏千亿也要敲钟：Anthropic 创纪录 IPO 背后的算力账单AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Nov 20, 20262011 月 19 日，成立不到六年的 Anthropic 登陆纳斯达克（代码 ANT），募资约 813 亿美元，创史上最大 IPO 纪录。发行价 83 美元，首日收报 97.17 美元、涨 17.07%，市值约 1.28 万亿美元，盘中一度摸到 2 万亿。连同 260 亿美元私募，合计募得约 1073 亿美元。9000 亿算力承诺，压着 810 亿 ARR 招股书里更扎眼的是另一组数字：前九个月净亏损超 1040 亿美元，但其中 943 亿只是负债公允价值变动，并非实际支出，经营亏损实为 12.6 亿。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI向ChatGPT Plus及Business用户开放dots智能助理测试</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9a40695c8f47606013a96c17b4f88324.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI核心产品负责人蒂博·索蒂奥宣布，全天候智能助理dots正式向部分ChatGPT Plus用户开启测试，并向所有Business Standard用户开放。dots的核心差异在于其内置“云电脑”架构，支持在后台自主执行排议程、构建网站、测试应用及修改笔记等复杂任务，并能根据用户反馈持续优化工作偏好。用户可自定义权限边界，设定哪些操作需人工确认。此外，OpenAI同步开启移动端改版测试，在底部标签栏为dots增设独立入口，并允许用户将Codex、Projects、Images等功能固定至底部。该改版支持通过“New ChatGPT Design”开关自由切换，首批覆盖具备创建dot资格的ChatGPT Pro用户。此次更新标志着dots从DevDay 2026的演示产品正式迈向实际应用阶段，通过云端自主</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
